bishop. Our bishop is ideally placed here, targeting the kingside and queenside.} 13.Bxe4 13...Bd7 {If Black now tries to preserve their bishop by moving it back...} 14.Qh5 {We've got the crushing Qh5, double attacking Black's bishop and threatening mate. Black can't defend against both threats and White is completely winning.} *

